/image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ZUNnqF9qAp6QnYBtTwxHXihpro.jpg"},{"id":5278208,"name":"Wang Ziyi","role":"The Boy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t2EJcG3EOCF0F3BdJUhWPK0D3xz.jpg"},{"id":586488,"name":"Alan Ng","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z6rJenJqjzzOFkUAGbHQfXBc1NA.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Little Big Soldier","overview":"Un soldato della dinastia Liang si risveglia sul campo di battaglia dopo essersi finto morto. Scopre che l'unico altro sopravvissuto al terribile scontro è un giovane generale di Wei. Il soldato decide di rapire il generale per avere una ricompensa. Non sa però che il giovane è l'erede al trono."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Little Big Soldier","overview":"The story of a farmer forced into conscription, who has been looking to get out of the army ever since. His great chance arrives when he stumbles upon a wounded general from an enemy state, and he kidnaps him, intending to claim credit for the capture, which includes five acres of land, and most importantly, honorable discharge from the army."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"大兵小将","overview":"公元前227年，卫国军队在凤凰山遭遇梁军伏击，一场血战过后，只剩下身受重伤的卫国大将军和靠装死逃过一劫的梁国小兵。大将军胸怀统一诸国的壮志，小兵却只想远离战争，过上安稳日子。为了换取良田和免除兵役，小兵决定将大将军押回梁国领赏。一路上，前有未知的危险，后有神秘的卫国追兵，两人身份悬殊、信念迥异，却不得不结伴穿越乱世，在一次次危机中展开一段啼笑皆非又危机四伏的归途……"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lfRCv4XOmXMHMlRgKnmsNa8sI8G.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lfRCv4XOmXMHMlRgKnmsNa8sI8G.png","language":"en","width":2099,"height":937},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/trJ0wwqDgt3ZCanYPogFPsM3FeP.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/trJ0wwqDgt3ZCanYPogFPsM3FeP.png","language":"zh","width":793,"height":224}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4SHmkvyGQU8ODpzYWcJ0BnX5ibU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4SHmkvyGQU8ODpzYWcJ0